<title>USA: K-tel International appoints new president.</title>
<headline>K-tel International appoints new president.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>K-tel International Inc said Monday it has appointed David Weiner as president of the company, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Weiner previously served as senior vice president of K-tel.</p>
<p>Weiner replaced Mickey Elfenbein, who left the company earlier this year, K-tel said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
